Step 4: Create a Portfolio Index Repository

On GitHub, create a new public repository named exactly: developer-portfolio

Do NOT initialise it with any files — keep it completely empty.

Clone it to your machine:

git clone https://github.com/<username>/developer-portfolio.git

cd ~/developer-portfolio

Create the portfolio index README (replace all [placeholders] with your real details)

cat > README.md << 'RDEOF'

# [Your Full Name] — Developer Portfolio

> B.Tech CSE Student | K.R. Mangalam University, Gurugram | Batch 2024-28

